This is new in v2 and critically important.

### Step 1 — Define subsystem contract  
### Step 2 — Invoke Universal Implementation Template in Cursor  
### Step 3 — AI produces repo scan + plan (NO CODE)  
### Step 4 — Approve module 1  
### Step 5 — AI implements module (diff only)  
### Step 6 — AI updates Handoff Dossier  
### Step 7 — Repeat until subsystem complete  
### Step 8 — Integrate subsystem orchestrator  
### Step 9 — Add tests  
### Step 10 — Update this architecture doc if subsystem is major  

This workflow ensures clarity, stability, and zero drift.

