14.4 Rollback Strategy
Each phase is independently reversible:
If Smart Ingestor fails:
Keep legacy_ingestor.py functional
Endpoints can route to old ingestion
No data loss (Neo4j schema unchanged)
If Decoherence Engine fails:
System remains functional without temporal simulation
Queries return static states
Degraded experience but not broken
If Query Engine refactor fails:
Revert to existing Query Agent
No change to external API
Subsystem extraction was non-destructive
Golden Rule: Never break working code until replacement is proven superior.
